source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A list item's own content is not a line start, so an escaped marker there is the only way to show the bare character.
-- input.jira --
* \* item
-- rendered.html --
<ul>
	<li>&#42; item</li>
</ul>
-- want.md --
- \* item
-- warnings.json --
[]
